abstract: >
  SUANR_V1 (Stochastic Uncertainty-Aware Neural Regression) is a
  research prototype that explores uncertainty-aware prediction
  through stochastic perturbation methods. The project serves as
  a preserved baseline within the MPRD Ecosystem and contributes
  to the study of uncertainty estimation, reliability assessment,
  and evidence-based research workflows.

